{
  "about": "Provenance of damit_runner/core/metalflood/ (Boann, the GPU flood engine). Each file is a byte-for-byte copy of DamSafety_Runner/core/metalflood/ at source_commit (DWR_Plugins main, 2026-11-24: DamSafety Runner 3.93.0 / Boann 6.0.0), the whole folder: the ACC engine and the sub-grid-channel engine (engine_sgc) that the DamIT Runner offers, the shock-capturing engines (FV, FV2, DG2), the sub-grid finite-volume engine (engine_subfv, subfv_*, subgrid) and the sub-grid local-inertial engine (engine_subli, subli_*) carried byte-identical but not offered as Runner engine choices, and Boann's own command line (boann.py, cli.py) and version (version.py, BOANN_VERSION). From DamIT Runner 0.10.0 (before: DWR main 01758ea1, Boann 5.0.0). No prebuilt/ CPU libraries are shipped (DamSafety's release workflow builds them); the CPU build is compiled once on first use. scripts/check_engine_parity.py compares the .py files with PARITY.json's synced_to; tests/test_gpu_engine.py checks the sha256 of every file below.",
